Be a key driver of partner success at scale while serving as a&nbsp;technical ambassador&nbsp;for Veeam’s industry-leading&nbsp;cyber resilience&nbsp;solutions. You’ll partner with strategic organizations, emerging technologies, and a collaborative team focused on helping customers&nbsp;protect and recover their most critical data.

***Must be located in Toronto***

