• Create relationships with partner technical leaders and influencers to expand mindshare in the account &nbsp;

• Foster relationships between partners and key Veeam personal company wide &nbsp;

• Assist sales personnel in executing on the partner account strategy to maximize Veeam revenue &nbsp;

• Provide pre-sales assistance and subject matter expertise to partners for meetings, demonstrations, proof of concepts as their customers evaluate Veeam software &nbsp;

• Effectively utilize available resources to meet and exceed area sales objectives &nbsp;

